Instrumentation for the original Mode, to trace its attract-mode replays.

Made against these two sources, which it applies to as they are (patch -p1, from a folder that holds both):
  Mode    AdamAtomic/Mode     commit cb6bdaeaf8d5   (Mode/ here)
  flixel  AdamAtomic/flixel   commit 4d6f5e8a1986   (flixel/ here)

It makes the game play one of its attract-mode replays from start-up (CONFIG::attract is 1 or 2), take exactly
one update for each frame the player runs, and trace:
  update N HASH      after each update's picture is drawn: the CRC-32 of the camera's picture, each pixel cut to
                     5 bits a channel and packed as a 15-bit colour (red lowest) in two bytes, low byte first;
  sound NAME V PAN   for each sound started;
  end N              when the replay ends, and it asks the player to stop.

